    "problem": null,
    "final_text": "I couldn't find a record name for this answer. The search results only show memory IDs, and I found no field that holds names like r0042, so I left citations empty.\n\nThe memory \"Eli Pine is the delivery owner for the Elm Beacon partner API\" (ID 0688142a-2ebf-4e2c-aba1-086606fc056f) gives the answer. I found no memory that reassigns the Elm Beacon partner API to anyone else. The only Elm Beacon ownership change I found covers security hardening, a different project.\n\n{\"answer\": \"Eli Pine\", \"citations\": []}",
